<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-FAI Life 95/96 net profit A$11.2 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-FAI Life 95/96 net profit A$11.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  11.2 vs 8.17</p>
<p>NOTE: FAI Life Ltd is a life insurance group.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit			26.69 vs 3.65</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		 3.00 vs 2.50</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		 6.00 vs 5.00</p>
<p>    Sales				    143.53 vs 182.23</p>
<p>    Other income			    48.97 vs 13.11 loss</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				10.3 vs 8.1</p>
<p>Abnormal items</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date Oct 4</p>
<p>Reg date Sept 19</p>
<p>    Tax				charge 15.49 vs credit 4.52</p>
<p>    Interest				  0.023 vs 0.004</p>
<p>    Depreciation			     1.72 vs 1.63</p>
<p>    Minorities				  nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: FAI Life is about 42 percent owned by FAI Insurances Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
